o mesh
  Journal file for cubit - Pillbox.jou
  Genesis file generated by cubit - Pillbox.gen
  Mesh converted by acdtool - Pillbox.ncdf
  Job script file on NERSC perlmutter-p1 - run-mesh.batch

  Procedure:
  - Run cubit on local computer
    Click "Play journal File" button, select "Pillbox.jou"
  - Generate netcdf file on NERSC by copying Pillbox.gen and run-meshconvert.batch to NERSC 
    scp Pillbox.gen user@perlmutter-p1.nersc.gov:directory_name/.
  - Submit job on perlmutter-p1
    sbatch run-meshconvert.batch
  - Pillbox.ncdf will be generated. Also check acdtool.log and acdtool.warn for mesh quality.

o Run Omega3P to get EM Field
   Omega3P startup file - Pillbox.omega3p   
   Job script file on NERSC perlmutter - run-omega3p.batch

  Procedure:
  - Submit job on perlmutter
    sbatch run-omega3p.batch

o Run Track3P to get Multipacting results 

   Run1: Scan field levels to get multipacting map
     Track3P startup file - Pillbox.track3p
     SEY curve file: copper.txt
     Job script file on NERSC perlmutter - run-track3p.batch

   Procedure:
     - Submit job on perlmutter
       sbatch run-track3p.batch


   Run2: Run on single field level to get particles' trajectory
     Track3P startup file - Pillbox2.3MV.track3p
     SEY curve file: copper.txt
     Job script file on NERSC perlmutter - run-track3ptrajectory.batch

    Procedure:
     - Submit job on perlmutter
       sbatch run-track3ptrajectory.batch


o Run acdtool to get data for visulization 
   acdtool startup file - Pillbox.acdtool
   SEY curve file: copper.txt
   Job script file on NERSC perlmutter - run-acdtool.batch                           

  Procedure:
  - Submit job on perlmutter
    sbatch run-acdtool.batch
  - When job is finished, copy data back to local computer
    scp -r user@perlmutter-p1.nersc.gov:directory_name/\* .


o Postprocessing
  - Click "SLAC" button, select mesh file "Pillbox.ncdf" and 
    mode file "omega3p_results/omega3p.l0.m0000.1.3138107e+09.mod", 
  - Click "resonant" button, select resonant output file 
    "track3p_results/OUTPUT/resonantparticles" to display resonant particles impact energy vs. field levels and resonant particles impact locations
  - Click "enhancement" button, select enhancementcounter output file 
    "track3p_results/OUTPUT/enhancementCounter" to display enhancement counter vs. field levels
  - Click "SLAC" button, select particlepath file "./2.3MV/PARTICLES/partpath_ts....ncdf" and click "play" button to see the animation
  - Click "singleparticletrajectory" button, select single particle trajectory output file 
    "./15600" or/and "./16500" to display single particle's trajectory


o Results
  FiledLevel-ImpactEnergy.png - resonant particles mapping plot
  Resonantlocation.png - resonant particles impact locations
  enhancementCounter.png - enhancement counter plot
  ParticlesSnapshop.png - particles' trajectory snap shop
  trajectory.png - two particles' trajectory
  trajectory.avi - particles trajectory movie
